          "candidate_line_count": 4,
          "center_error": 0.099,
          "text": "Notice on Revising the \"Measures for the\nManagement of Domestic Project Operations of CCECC FUZHOU SURVEY & DESIGN INSTITUTE CO.\""
        },
        {
          "page": 1,
          "role": "salutation",
          "source_block": 5,
          "candidate_block": 6,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 53.47,
          "text": "To all departments and affiliated units of the company:"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "centered_text",
          "source_block": 1,
          "candidate_block": 2,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 0.18,
          "text": "Measures for the Management of Domestic Project Operations of CCECC FUZHOU SURVEY & DESIGN INSTITUTE CO."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 3,
          "candidate_block": 4,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 0.111,
          "text": "Chapter 1 General Provisions"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 4,
          "candidate_block": 5,
          "candidate_line_count": 7,
          "center_error": 16.904,
          "text": "Article 1 In accordance with the guiding opinions on high­quality operational\nwork of the joint­stock company, and considering the relevant requirements of the\nGroup Company's \"Implementation Rules for High­Quality Operational Work\n(Trial)\" (Zhong Tu Jing Ying 2024 No. 341), these Measures are formulated to\ncomprehensively improve project operational quality, effectively manage the\ncompany's domestic operations, and standardize operational procedures and\nworkflows."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 8,
          "candidate_block": 6,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 13.451,
          "text": "Article 2 The projects referred to in these Measures include various types of\ncompany business operations such as consulting, survey, design, supervision, and\ngeneral contracting, undertaken through direct commission or bidding."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 10,
          "candidate_block": 7,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 23.135,
          "text": "Article 3 The work of operational undertaking shall, in principle, follow the\nprocedure of first conducting project evaluation, then applying for approval, and\nfinally signing the contract."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 12,
          "candidate_block": 8,
          "candidate_line_count": 8,
          "center_error": 17.804,
          "text": "Article 4 When carrying out project operational undertaking work, factors\nsuch as the company's development strategy, business direction, responsibility\ncost, production and technical capabilities, and current status shall be\ncomprehensively considered. According to the process regulations of these\nMeasures, the work stages including \"information tracking, project evaluation and\napplication, bid document preparation and review, contract negotiation, contract\nreview and signing, owner service during project implementation, and project\nreturn visit\" shall be completed."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 17,
          "candidate_block": 9,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 0.127,
          "text": "Chapter 2 Relevant Responsibilities"
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 18,
          "candidate_block": 10,
          "candidate_line_count": 3,
          "center_error": 26.533,
          "text": "Article 5 The Business Development Department is the management\ndepartment for the company's domestic project operations, responsible for the\nlayout and expansion of the institute's operational market."
        },
        {
          "page": 2,
          "role": "article_text",
          "source_block": 20,
          "candidate_block": 11,
          "candidate_line_count": 2,
          "center_error": 26.689,
          "text": "Article 6 The relevant personnel involved in project operational work and\ntheir main responsibilities are shown in Table 1:"
        },
        {
          "page": 3,
          "role": "centered_text",
          "source_block": 1,
          "candidate_block": 1,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 0.145,
          "text": "Table 1 Main Responsibilities of Personnel Participating in Operational Undertaking Work"
        },
        {
          "page": 3,
          "role": "chapter_heading",
          "source_block": 18,
          "candidate_block": 2,
          "candidate_line_count": 1,
          "center_error": 0.178,
          "text": "Chapter 3 Project Evaluation and Undertaking"
